<!--
  TeXture.Core: everything that is shared by the PowerPoint and Word add-ins.
  Host-specific code (object model access) lives behind IHostAdapter in the VSTO projects.
  Classic (non-SDK) project so VSTO runtime assemblies resolve from the GAC exactly like
  they do for the add-in projects.
-->
